{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11233020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11233020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123302001:1":{"text":"괜찮아요? 무슨 일 있어요?","source_cn":"您还好吗？出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FAF1A447B5C21F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123302002:1":{"text":"괜찮을 리가! 젊은 시절의 적은 내 눈앞에 서 있는 존재라면, 늙은 후의 적은 내 몸뚱아리라는 말이 있지!","source_cn":"怎么会好？年轻的时候敌人都实实在在站在面前，上了年纪敌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341A2EA64ACFB088","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123302003:1":{"text":"하쉬르가 넘어질 것 같아요! 치피, 어서!","source_cn":"哈什尔要摔倒了！满满快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32FD985A8639A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123302004:1":{"text":"잡았어! 괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"扶住了！您没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9247FBB0E11D0EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123302005:1":{"text":"호들갑 떨지 마라. 발을 헛디딘 것뿐이니까. 헉... 헉.","source_cn":"别大惊小怪的，我只是一步没站稳而已，呼……呼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5925C4D3A8BDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123302006:1":{"text":"그런데 이 털뭉치... 힘이... 보기보다 꽤 좋구나.","source_cn":"没想到……你这小毛团劲儿还挺大的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF108720745143B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123302007:1":{"text":"헤헤, 치피는 기사니까요! 기사는 힘이 세야 해요!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，满满是骑士！骑士就要有大力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB609B5A210806E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1123302007":{"text":"헤헤, 치피는 기사니까요! 기사는 힘이 세야 해요!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，满满是骑士！骑士就要有大力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB609B5A210806E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123302008:1":{"text":"뱀뼈풀.","source_cn":"蛇骨草。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFF463F4B0607E4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123302009:1":{"text":"잘은 모르겠지만, 이 근처에서 뱀뼈풀을 기르고 계시던 거 아니에요?","source_cn":"虽然不太确定，您身边种植的不就是蛇骨草吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD87377677CE62CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1123302010:1":{"text":"그건 아직 덜 자란데다 개수도 한참 모자라!","source_cn":"这些还未成熟，并且数量也远远不够。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0264170DA42F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123302011:1":{"text":"마침 여기까지 왔으니 이 자루 받고, 가서 다 자란 뱀뼈풀을 좀 모아오거라.","source_cn":"既然你们来了，袋子拿去，给我取一些成熟的蛇骨草来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE05A9BB19BC94CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1123302012:1":{"text":"이건... 골드잖아요?","source_cn":"这袋子里的……是金币？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70EA441960BFD2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1123302012":{"text":"이건... 골드잖아요?","source_cn":"这袋子里的……是金币？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70EA441960BFD2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1123302013:1":{"text":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","source_cn":"头一次见到你这种怪人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23FE78223A9FABF9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","female":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","variant_male_record_index":"126080","variant_female_record_index":"126081","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1123302014:1":{"text":"그래. 어쨌든 길바닥에서 굴러먹는 노인네에게 이런 건 별 의미가 없지.","source_cn":"好吧，反正这些对于我这个野外求生的老人来说，已经没什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E2D4EED71BB744","varia